---
---
<section>
  <div class="slide-content" style="background:#121212; width:100%; height:100%; overflow:hidden; font-family:'Inter',sans-serif;">
    <div style="position:relative; width:100%; height:100%; display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center;">

      <!-- Línea top -->
      <div style="position:absolute; top:0; left:0; right:0; height:3px; background: linear-gradient(to right, transparent, #FFF7CD 40%, transparent);"></div>

      <!-- Número de slide (superior derecho) -->
      <div style="position:absolute; top:28px; right:48px; font-size:11px; color:rgba(167,159,142,0.3); font-weight:600; letter-spacing:0.15em;">06 / 15</div>

      <div style="position:relative; z-index:10; max-width:960px; width:100%; padding:0 64px;">

        <p style="font-size:11px; color:#FFF7CD; letter-spacing:0.25em; text-transform:uppercase; font-weight:600; margin:0 0 16px 0;">Análisis PEST · Macroentorno</p>
        <h2 style="font-size:38px; font-weight:800; color:#FFF7CD; margin:0 0 32px 0; letter-spacing:-0.02em;">Contexto que <span style="color:#FAF0B5;">nos impulsa</span></h2>

        <!-- 4 variables en grid 2x2 -->
        <div style="display:grid; grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr; gap:12px;">

          <!-- Tecnológica -->
          <div style="padding:24px; background:rgba(255,247,205,0.06); border:1px solid rgba(255,247,205,0.3); display:flex; gap:20px; align-items:flex-start;">
            <div style="min-width:48px; height:48px; background:#FFF7CD; display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; font-size:20px; font-weight:900; color:#121212;">T</div>
            <div>
              <div style="font-size:15px; font-weight:700; color:#FFF7CD; margin-bottom:6px;">Tecnológica <span style="font-size:11px; color:#FFF7CD; margin-left:8px; font-weight:600;">IMPACTO MUY ALTO</span></div>
              <p style="font-size:13px; color:#a79f8e; margin:0; line-height:1.5;">IA, frameworks modernos y economía del conocimiento aceleran la demanda de software de calidad.</p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Económica -->
          <div style="padding:24px; background:rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border:1px solid rgba(255,247,205,0.2); display:flex; gap:20px; align-items:flex-start;">
            <div style="min-width:48px; height:48px; background:rgba(255,247,205,0.15); border:1px solid rgba(255,247,205,0.3); display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; font-size:20px; font-weight:900; color:#FFF7CD;">E</div>
            <div>
              <div style="font-size:15px; font-weight:700; color:#FFF7CD; margin-bottom:6px;">Económica <span style="font-size:11px; color:#FAF0B5; margin-left:8px; font-weight:600;">IMPACTO ALTO</span></div>
              <p style="font-size:13px; color:#a79f8e; margin:0; line-height:1.5;">Volatilidad cambiaria encarece licencias extranjeras → oportunidad para desarrollo local en pesos.</p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Cultural -->
          <div style="padding:24px; background:rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border:1px solid rgba(255,247,205,0.2); display:flex; gap:20px; align-items:flex-start;">
            <div style="min-width:48px; height:48px; background:rgba(255,247,205,0.15); border:1px solid rgba(255,247,205,0.3); display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; font-size:20px; font-weight:900; color:#FFF7CD;">C</div>
            <div>
              <div style="font-size:15px; font-weight:700; color:#FFF7CD; margin-bottom:6px;">Cultural <span style="font-size:11px; color:#FAF0B5; margin-left:8px; font-weight:600;">IMPACTO ALTO</span></div>
              <p style="font-size:13px; color:#a79f8e; margin:0; line-height:1.5;">79% del sector IT opera en modalidad remota. Digitalización masiva en consumo y educación.</p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Legal -->
          <div style="padding:24px; background:rgba(255,255,255,0.02); border:1px solid rgba(255,247,205,0.1); display:flex; gap:20px; align-items:flex-start;">
            <div style="min-width:48px; height:48px; background:rgba(255,255,255,0.05); border:1px solid rgba(255,247,205,0.15); display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; font-size:20px; font-weight:900; color:#a79f8e;">L</div>
            <div>
              <div style="font-size:15px; font-weight:700; color:#a79f8e; margin-bottom:6px;">Legal <span style="font-size:11px; color:#a79f8e; margin-left:8px; font-weight:600;">IMPACTO MEDIO</span></div>
              <p style="font-size:13px; color:#a79f8e; margin:0; line-height:1.5;">Ley 25.326 de datos personales. Homologación hacia estándares RGPD europeos en curso.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
